---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Echo Garden" description="A generative p5.js environment that grows in response to time and interaction.">
  <article class="project">

    <header class="project-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">generative media · 2025</span>
      <h1 class="display-xl project-title">Echo Garden</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="hero-image">
      <img
        src="/images/echo-garden/hero.jpg"
        alt="Echo Garden: dense grid of shifting text characters resolving into a figure"
        class="hero-img"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="project-body">

      <p class="lead">
        Echo Garden is a generative p5.js environment that grows in response to time and interaction. Text stands in for pixels: words, stray phrases, fragments left behind by whoever passed through, densifying into a shifting character grid until a figure resolves out of it, the way an image resolves out of noise the longer you look.
      </p>

      <p>
        Visitors could add to it too. A prompt at the edge of the installation read "add a thought, type below or scan QR": type directly into the piece, or scan the code to add from your own phone. A button marked Plant submits it. Echo Garden became a community garden this way: not one voice growing the piece, but everyone who passed through it, each thought folding into the next visitor's view of a digital garden that kept growing after they left.
      </p>

      <div class="image-pair">
        <div class="project-image">
          <img
            src="/images/echo%20garden/IMG_5179.jpg"
            alt="Full wall projection of Echo Garden, with the add-a-thought prompt and QR code visible"
            class="content-img"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="project-image">
          <img
            src="/images/echo%20garden/3F5BDE58-F197-4D1D-9D9B-10FB5EE74EE1.jpg"
            alt="Close detail of the shifting text-character grid"
            class="content-img"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-image">
        <img
          src="/images/echo%20garden/4180A380-617D-4A69-9B96-DA031F63498B.jpg"
          alt="Nadine standing beside the installation"
          class="content-img"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'"
        />
      </div>

      <p>
        Shown at IADE – Universidade Europeia, Lisbon, 2025.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="project-meta">
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">year</span>
        <span class="meta-value">2025</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">medium</span>
        <span class="meta-value">generative media: p5.js</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">venue</span>
        <span class="meta-value">IADE – Universidade Europeia, Lisbon · 2025</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">tools</span>
        <span class="meta-value">p5.js · JavaScript</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .project {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--page-padding-x) var(--space-8);
  }

  .project-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }
  .project-title {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .hero-image {
    background: var(--surface);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    min-height: 340px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .project-body {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }
  .lead {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    font-weight: var(--w-light);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
    color: var(--mid);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  p {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: var(--w-light);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
    color: var(--mid);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .project-image {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .content-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .image-pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
  }
  .image-pair .project-image {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .project-meta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
  }
  .meta-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-2) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .meta-label {
    color: var(--gold);
    align-self: start;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .meta-value {
    font-weight: var(--w-light);
    color: var(--mid);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .project {
      padding: var(--space-5) var(--page-padding-x-sm) var(--space-7);
    }
    .image-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .meta-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
  }
</style>
